alba lets his men hail him: legate of the Senate and People, he says, not yet emperor."},{"t":1,"loc":"GSU","text":"Titus Arrius Priscus, legate of IV Macedonica, claims the purple in Germania Superior."},{"t":1,"loc":null,"text":"Publius Hordeonius Marcellus swears to you when your province falls: a legate of one of your legions. He can command an army or govern a province for you."},{"t":1,"loc":null,"text":"A truce is agreed between Servius Sulpicius Galba and Titus Arrius Priscus."},{"t":2,"loc":"ROM","text":"Nero's exiles come home and get their estates back. Their families remember who did it."},{"t":2,"loc":"AFR","text":"In Africa, Clodius Macer, legate of III Augusta, holds back the grain ships and raises a legion of his own."},{"t":2,"loc":null,"text":"An alliance is agreed between Servius Sulpicius Galba and Lucius Clodius Macer."},{"t":3,"loc":"ROM","text":"Nero is dead. Abandoned by the Praetorians, he took his own life outside Rome. The Senate rules, for now."},{"t":4,"loc":"ROM","text":"The Senate declares Titus Arrius Priscus a public enemy of the Roman people."},{"t":5,"loc":"SYR","text":"Decimus Tettius Flaccus, legate of IV Scythica, claims the purple in Syria."},{"t":5,"loc":"GSU","text":"Lucius Vipstanus Balbus, your governor of Germania Superior, claims the province for himself."},{"t":5,"loc":null,"text":"Lucius Vipstanus Balbus has lost his last legion. His cause is finished."},{"t":6,"loc":"JUD","text":"Quintus Pomponius Sabinus, legate of V Macedonica, claims the purple in Judaea."},{"t":6,"loc":"MCA","text":"The Mauretanian chiefs send 3000 men to Servius Sulpicius Galba."},{"t":7,"loc":null,"text":"An alliance is agreed between Titus Arrius Priscus and you."},{"t":7,"loc":"GIN","text":"On the lower Rhine, Fonteius Capito is said to want the purple for himself."},{"t":7,"loc":"MOE","text":"Marcus Herennius Severus, legate of III Gallica, claims the purple in Moesia."},{"t":7,"loc":"NOR","text":"Road repairs finished in Noricum."},{"t":7,"loc":"GIN","text":"It is known in Rome that Gaius Julius Vindex paid Julius Civilis of the Batavians to rise against Romans. The Senate is appalled."},{"t":8,"loc":null,"text":"Sextus Numisius Bassus swears to you. He can command an army or govern a province for you."},{"t":8,"loc":"SYR","text":"Vologases sends envoys and gifts to Decimus Tettius Flaccus: friendship, and the caravans of the East."},{"t":9,"loc":null,"text":"Your legions hail you as imperator."},{"t":9,"loc":null,"text":"A truce is agreed between Marcus Herennius Severus and Decimus Tettius Flaccus."},{"t":9,"loc":"MOE","text":"Marcus Herennius Severus buys VII Claudia."},{"t":9,"loc":"MOE","text":"Marcus Herennius Severus buys VIII Augusta."},{"t":10,"loc":"GIN","text":"On the Rhine, the legions refuse their oath and hail Aulus Vitellius emperor."},{"t":10,"loc":"CMP","text":"Marcus Salvius Otho, once Nero's friend, buys the Praetorians and claims the throne."},{"t":10,"loc":null,"text":"A truce is agreed between Quintus Pomponius Sabinus and Decimus Tettius Flaccus."},{"t":10,"loc":null,"text":"A truce is agreed between Aulus Vitellius and Gaius Julius Vindex."},{"t":10,"loc":null,"text":"A truce is agreed between Marcus Salvius Otho and Marcus Herennius Severus."},{"t":10,"loc":"PAN","text":"Pannonia: your men are beaten against a walled town."},{"t":11,"loc":"MOE","text":"The Roxolani cross the frozen Danube into Moesia."},{"t":11,"loc":"SYR","text":"Vologases sends envoys and gifts to Quintus Pomponius Sabinus: friendship, and the caravans of the East."}],"rel":{"F5|galba":12,"galba|macer":15,"macer|vindex":-9,"F5|player":15,"capito|vindex":-30,"F15|F28":12,"F15|otho":-3,"F15|F22":15,"vindex|vitellius":15,"F28|otho":15},"treaties":[{"id":2,"type":"alliance","a":"galba","b":"macer","target":"player","hostages":false,"from":2,"until":14},{"id":5,"type":"alliance","a":"F5","b":"player","target":"vindex","hostages":false,"from":7,"until":19},{"id":6,"type":"truce","a":"F28","b":"F15","target":null,"ho